{"ID":"20240206104545-8we7xd9","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206104545-8we7xd9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206104545-8we7xd9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206104554-rgvltys\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206104549-e6dx6eh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206104554-rgvltys\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:119,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:119\u0026#125;","title":"垂盆草","type":"doc","updated":"20240830163206"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206104554-rgvltys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206104554-rgvltys","updated":"20240206104600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产浙江、安徽、江苏、湖北等地。\n【性状】\t该品茎纤细，长可达20cm以上，部分节上可见纤细的不定根。3叶轮生，叶片倒披针形至矩圆形，绿色，肉质，长1.52.8cm，宽0.30.7cm，先端近急尖，基部急狭，有距。气微，味微苦。\n【性味】\t甘、淡，凉。\n【功效】\t清利湿热，解毒。用于湿热黄疸，小便不利，痈肿疮疡，急、慢性肝炎。有降低谷丙转氨酶作用。用于急性肝炎、迁延性肝炎、慢性肝炎的活动性。"}]},{"ID":"20240206104549-e6dx6eh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206104549-e6dx6eh","updated":"20240206104549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206104549-uk6gnhw.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240710190415-d8px8du","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710190415-d8px8du","updated":"20240710191756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 601px;","style":"width: 591px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"垂盆草 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/垂盆草 10-20240710191756-21e7cyd.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 591px;\" parent-style=\"width: 601px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 602px;","style":"width: 592px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"垂盆草 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/垂盆草 9-20240710191646-j1zapgl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 592px;\" parent-style=\"width: 602px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710191353-8yekonx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710191353-8yekonx","updated":"20240710192213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 628px;","style":"width: 618px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"垂盆草 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/垂盆草 7-20240710191224-wbl0vz2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 618px;\" parent-style=\"width: 628px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 629px;","style":"width: 619px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"垂盆草 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/垂盆草 8-20240710191353-sio6xw5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 619px;\" parent-style=\"width: 629px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710191104-313vk7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710191104-313vk7t","updated":"20240710192650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 260px;","style":"width: 250px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"垂盆草 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/垂盆草 6-20240710191104-lrmybmh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 250px;\" parent-style=\"width: 260px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 383px;","style":"width: 373px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"垂盆草 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/垂盆草 13-20240710192317-kzj0xla.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 373px;\" parent-style=\"width: 383px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 591px;","style":"width: 581px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"垂盆草 (15)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/垂盆草 15-20240710192650-wgn0kbg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 581px;\" parent-style=\"width: 591px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710192453-emnil53","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710192453-emnil53","updated":"20240710192503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 287px;","style":"width: 277px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"垂盆草 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/垂盆草 12-20240710192040-opxpc47.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 277px;\" parent-style=\"width: 287px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 806px;","style":"width: 796px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"垂盆草 (14)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/垂盆草 14-20240710192448-csqqc38.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 796px;\" parent-style=\"width: 806px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710190853-sohgzjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710190853-sohgzjz","updated":"20240710191011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 429px;","style":"width: 419px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"垂盆草 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/垂盆草 4-20240710190853-duw5ro9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 419px;\" parent-style=\"width: 429px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 837px;","style":"width: 827px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"垂盆草 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/垂盆草 5-20240710190955-gue58nl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 827px;\" parent-style=\"width: 837px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710191938-drh07iz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710191938-drh07iz","updated":"20240710192756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 554px;","style":"width: 544px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"垂盆草 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/垂盆草 11-20240710191938-o6awbrn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 544px;\" parent-style=\"width: 554px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 565px;","style":"width: 555px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"垂盆草 (16)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/垂盆草 16-20240710192756-gosa324.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 555px;\" parent-style=\"width: 565px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710192158-dtgllag","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240710192158-dtgllag"}},{"ID":"20240830163200-i4tr22v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-i4tr22v","updated":"20240830163206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：垂盆草"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-y876bik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-y876bik","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"垂盆草《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-uybr97v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-uybr97v","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ChuíPénCǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-6mtxhxt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-6mtxhxt","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】HERBASEDI"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-jdir3tf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-jdir3tf","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】狗牙半支、石指甲、半支莲、养鸡草、狗牙齿、瓜子草"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-xu1so1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-xu1so1z","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为景天科植物垂盆草SedumsarmentosumBunge的新鲜或干燥全草。夏、秋二季采收，除去杂质。鲜用或干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-x2zz0fc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-x2zz0fc","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品茎纤细，长可达20cm以上，部分节上可见纤细的不定根。3叶轮生，叶片倒披针形至矩圆形，绿色，肉质，长1.5～2.8cm，宽0.3～0.7cm，先端近急尖，基部急狭，有距。气微，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-o4hux9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-o4hux9a","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】本品茎的横切面：表皮细胞长方形，外壁增厚，内层约为10列薄壁细胞。中柱小，维管束外韧型，导管类圆形。髓部呈三角状，细胞多角形，壁甚厚，非木化。紧靠韧皮部细胞及髓部细胞中含红棕色分泌物。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-3hga1hz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-3hga1hz","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】除去泥沙杂质，干品切段。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-oitjrtp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-oitjrtp","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘、淡，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-bnmz7w2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-bnmz7w2","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肝、胆、小肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-kebjf7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-kebjf7e","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清利湿热，解毒。用于湿热黄疸，小便不利，痈肿疮疡，急、慢性肝炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-m3cgm8t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-m3cgm8t","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】鲜品250g，干品15～30g。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-j8ydlqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-j8ydlqj","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】鲜品随用随采，干品置干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-kwzxq6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-kwzxq6k","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-hbtmjyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-hbtmjyj","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）对于水火烫伤，可用鲜草洗净捣汁外涂；用于痈肿初起，除煎汤内服外，同时用鲜草洗净捣烂外敷，还可消痈退肿。垂盆草善解蛇毒，为民间治疗毒蛇咬伤的常用药品，可单用鲜草半斤，用冷开水洗净，捣烂绞汁内服，每日一至二次；也可配合半枝莲、野菊花、鬼针草、车前草、生大黄等药煎汤内服，并用鲜草洗净捣烂外敷。单用本品治疗传染性肝炎（包括急性黄疸性肝炎，急性无黄疸性肝炎，以及迁延性肝炎，慢性肝炎的活动期），对降低血清转氨脢有一定作用，且可使患者的口苦、胃口不好、小便黄赤等湿热症状减轻或消除。此外，本品近又用于癌肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-d939aya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-d939aya","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）垂盆草原为民间治疗疮痈及毒蛇咬伤的常用草药，但因一般中药店不备，故过去在临床上殊少应用。近年来发现本品可用治传染性肝炎，对降低转氨脢有良好的近期疗效；根据临床初步体会，有些病患在停药后又有转氨脢升高的现象，为了提高疗效，有待进一步实践与研究。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-e349a4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-e349a4a","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）本品叶小，形似鼠牙，故别名为鼠牙半枝莲，但称为半枝莲的尚有唇形科的开头草，为了避免品种混淆起见，以用“垂盆草”的名称为妥。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-wo7cxmq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-wo7cxmq","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-f70ryfu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-f70ryfu","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"垂盆草《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-23arlfg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-23arlfg","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ChuíPénCǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-tctdfoy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-tctdfoy","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】狗牙齿、半枝莲、三叶佛甲草"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-gc0ckuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-gc0ckuy","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为景天科植物垂盆草SedumsarmentosumBunge的全草。夏、秋季采挖，除去杂质，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-c0rf1iv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-c0rf1iv","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生肉质草本，不育枝匍匐生根，结实枝直立，长10～20cm。叶3片轮生，倒披针形至长圆形，长15～25mm，宽3～5mm，顶端尖，基部渐狭，全缘。聚伞花序疏松，常3～5分枝；花淡黄色，无梗；萼片5，阔披针形至长圆形，长3.5～5mm，顶端稍钝；花瓣5，披针形至长圆形，长5～8mm，顶端外侧有长尖头；雄蕊10，较花瓣短；心皮5，稍开展。种子细小，卵圆形，无翅，表面有乳头突起。花期5～6月，果期7～8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-41gsu0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-41gsu0q","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生于山坡岩石上或栽培。分布我国南北。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-tph001b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-tph001b","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】含N-甲基异石榴皮碱（N-methylisopelletierine）二氢-N-甲基异石榴皮碱、景天庚酮糖（sedoheptulose）、葡萄糖、果糖、蔗糖。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-skzkcat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-skzkcat","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】性凉，味甘、凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-ao5md3g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-ao5md3g","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清利湿热，有降低谷丙转氨酶作用。用于急性胩炎、迁延性肝炎、慢性肝炎的活动性。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-y0ixk32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-y0ixk32","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-zganotl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-zganotl","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"垂盆草《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-proe3yf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-proe3yf","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ChuíPénCǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-d77nrjd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-d77nrjd","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】山护花、鼠牙半支，半枝莲、狗牙草、佛指甲、瓜子草、三叶佛甲草、白蜈蚣、地蜈蚣草、太阳花、枉开口、石指甲、狗牙瓣。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-pfhc0fa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-pfhc0fa","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-u5trr2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-u5trr2k","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为景天科植物垂盆草的全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-lzgut0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-lzgut0y","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：SedumsarmentosumBunge[S.sheareriS.Moore]"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-lknefxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-lknefxd","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：四季可采，晒干或鲜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-67a12dk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-67a12dk","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】垂盆草多年生肉质草本。全株无毛。根纤维状，不育茎匍匐，长10-25cm，接近地面的节处易生根。叶常为3片轮生；叶片倒披针形全长圆形，长1.5-2.5cm，宽3-7mm，先端近急尖，基部下延，狭而有距，全缘。聚伞花序，项生，有3-5分枝，花小，无梗；萼片5裂，宽披针形，不等长，长3.5-5mm；花瓣5，黄色，披针形至长圆形，长5-8mm；雄蕊10，2轮，比花瓣短；鳞片5，楔状四方形，先端稍微凹；心皮5，长圆形，略叉开，长5-6mm。蓇葖果，内有多数细小的种子。种子卵圆形，表面有细小的乳头状突起。花期5-7月，果期7-8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-so4aza4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-so4aza4","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-z1ktqjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-z1ktqjv","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于海拔1600m以下的向阳山坡、石隙、沟边及路旁湿润处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-fl3e6l1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-fl3e6l1","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布十吉林、辽宁、河北、山西、陕西、甘肃、山东、江苏、安徽、浙江、江西、福建、河南、湖北、湖南、四川、贵州等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-1u73jdo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-1u73jdo","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-0svt9ok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-0svt9ok","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性喜阴湿环境，较耐寒，适宜肥沃的砂质壤上栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-h8dbhve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-h8dbhve","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术用分株、扦插繁殖。分株繁殖：北方于春季4-5月，挖出全林，分株后按行株距30cm×15cm栽种，每穴l-2株。扦插繁殖：截取健壮枝条，扦插于苗床中，经常保持床上湿润。L0d左右即叶生根，成活率90％以上。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-hujeedi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-hujeedi","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理生长期间注意松土除草，为了预防高温季节日照过强，可适当间作白凤仙、决明子、望江南或其他中草药遮荫。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-w1bcrv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-w1bcrv6","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-tflov9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-tflov9s","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别干燥全草稍卷缩。根细短，茎纤细，棕绿色，长4-8cm，直径1-2mm，茎上有10余个稍向外凸的褐色环状节，节上有的残留不定根，先端有时带花；质地较韧或脆，断面中心淡黄色。叶片级缩，易破碎并脱落，完整叶片呈倒披针形至矩圆形，棕绿色，长1.5cm，宽0.4cm。花序聚伞状；小花黄白色。气微，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-x17ig9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-x17ig9g","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别茎横切面：表皮为1列类长方形细胞，外壁增厚。皮层约为茎的2/3，内外侧l-2列细胞的壁呈连珠状增厚，非木化。维管束外韧型。髓部三角形，细胞壁厚，非木化，有明显的孔沟，胞腔狭小。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-0omyx4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-0omyx4w","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】全草含有消旋甲基异石榴皮碱（methylisopelletierine），二氧异石榴皮碱（dihydroisopelletierine），3-甲酸-1，4-二羟基二氢吡喃（3-formyl-1，4-dihydroxy-dihydropyran），N-甲基-2β-羟丙基哌啶（N-methyl-2β-hydroxypropyl-piperidine），垂盆草甙（sarmentosine），β-谷甾醇（β-sitosterol），甘露醇（mannitol）和氨基酸及葡萄糖、果糖和景天庚糖（sedoheptulose）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-3zz2905","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-3zz2905","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】理化鉴别取本品粉末10g，置于索氏提取器中，用丙酮回流提取6h,滤过。滤液减压浓缩至约2ml，加等体积的水溶解，再减压轴尽丙酮，得叶绿素状物。加适量水溶解（少量多次，总共约10ml），滤过。水液减压抽干，加甲醇2ml溶解，再加硅胶l-2g拌和，干燥后装入盛有硅胶10g的层析柱上端（内径约1.5cm），以氯仿一甲醇（5：1）冲洗，弃去最初洗脱液约35ml，收集以后的洗脱液约80ml，蒸干，残渣作以下试验：（1）取残渣少许，加固体二氧化锰约10mg，于小试管中混匀，管口覆盖1张滤纸小片，用橡皮筋扎紧密闭，并于纸上加10％硫酸亚铁溶液1滴，再加20％氢氧化钠溶液1滴，将试管置火上小心加热，待管内冒烟后移去火源，加浓盐酸1滴于纸片上，即显蓝绿色。（检查脂肪族氰基）（2）薄层色谱上述洗脱液浓缩后为样品液。用垂盆草甙照品制成对照品溶液，取样品液及对照品液点样于同一硅胶G薄层板上，以氯仿一甲醇（8：3）展开，展距6cm，喷以30％-50％硫酸液，于110℃下加热5-10min显色，样品液色谱在与对照品色谱相应位置处，现相同的黑色斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-ihedvrq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-ihedvrq","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】除去泥沙杂质，干品切段。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-ma8j9h4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-ma8j9h4","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘、淡、凉；酸"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-eg17t5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-eg17t5m","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肝、胆、小肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-knc9cni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-knc9cni","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热利湿；解毒消肿。主湿热黄疸；淋病；泻痢；肺痈；肠痈；疮疖肿毒；蛇虫咬伤；水火烫伤；咽喉肿痛；口腔溃疡及湿疹；带状疱疹"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-4yyp7yf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-4yyp7yf","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，15-30g；鲜品50-100g；或捣汁。外用：适量，捣敷；或研末调搽；或取汁外涂；或煎水湿敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-64r6y5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-64r6y5u","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】脾胃虚寒者慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-apubb2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-apubb2l","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】用于湿热黄疸，小便不利，痈肿疮疡；急、慢性肝炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163200-oavu0i3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163200-oavu0i3","updated":"20240830163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163202-mdild9x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830163202-mdild9x","updated":"20240830163214"}},{"ID":"20240830163203-42p04h3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163203-42p04h3","updated":"20240830163214"}}]}